<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88371" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόποσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drinking before</i> or
			<i>to</i> one, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπόσεις πίνειν</span>
			drink <i>healths,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				49
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιὼν . . προπόσεις τρεῖς ἴσως ἢ
					τέτταρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					82
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀποδωρεῖσθαι, ὀρέγειν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Critias
				<u>Fr.</u>
				6.3
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμβάνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					30.26.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.133
			</span></i>(<i><span class="en">
				Posidipp.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπόσεις ἐν τοῖς συμποσίοις ποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					10.432d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεξιοῦσθαι ἀλλήλους ταῖς π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					6.14.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				6.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>drink</i> itself, <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				167.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βρομίου νεκτάρεαι π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BMus.Inscr.</u>
					1036
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Caria</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>drinking before</i> food, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατος ἢ οἴνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CD</u>
					1.3
				</span></i>
			 (pl.); sg., <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				9.26
			</span></i>.</div>
